      "english": "On “菜”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "在汉语中，“菜”这个词很有意思。",
      "traditional": "在漢語中，“菜”這個詞很有意思。",
      "pinyin": "zài hàn yǔ zhōng cài zhè ge cí hěn yǒu yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我们可以用它说吃的“菜”，也可以用它说“人”。",
      "traditional": "我們可以用它說吃的“菜”，也可以用它說“人”。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men kě yǐ yòng tā shuō chī de cài yě kě yǐ yòng tā shuō rén",
      "english": "In Chinese, the word “菜” is very interesting."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "We can use it to refer to the “菜” that we eat, and we can also use it to refer to people."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "如果一个人说“TA不是我的菜”，意思是说话的这个人不喜欢TA。",
      "traditional": "如果一個人說“TA不是我的菜”，意思是說話的這個人不喜歡TA。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ yí ge rén shuō tā bú shì wǒ de cài yì si shì shuō huà de zhè ge rén bù xǐ huan tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“菜”在这里是说“喜欢的人”。你可以这么用：“虽然他很好，但他不是我的菜。”",
      "traditional": "“菜”在這裡是說“喜歡的人”。你可以這麼用：“雖然他很好，但他不是我的菜。”",
      "pinyin": "cài zài zhè lǐ shì shuō xǐ huan de rén nǐ kě yǐ zhè me yòng suī rán tā hěn hǎo dàn tā bú shì wǒ de cài",
      "english": "If someone says “they are not my ‘菜’”, it means that the person speaking does not like that person."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Here, the term “菜” refers to “someone you like”. You can use it like this: “Although he is nice, he’s not my ‘菜’.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "如果一个人做一个事情做得不好，我们可以说：“他很菜”。",
      "traditional": "如果一個人做一個事情做得不好，我們可以說：“他很菜”。",
      "pinyin": "rú guǒ yí ge rén zuò yí ge shì qing zuò de bù hǎo wǒ men kě yǐ shuō tā hěn cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "你有时候会听到：“他打游戏太菜了。”",
      "traditional": "你有時候會聽到：“他打遊戲太菜了。”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ yǒu shí hou huì tīng dào tā dǎ yóu xì tài cài le",
      "english": "If someone is not good at something, we can say, “He is very ‘菜’.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“菜”在这里是说这个人打游戏打得不好。",
      "traditional": "“菜”在這裡是說這個人打遊戲打得不好。",
      "pinyin": "cài zài zhè lǐ shì shuō zhè ge rén dǎ yóu xì dǎ de bù hǎo",
      "english": "Sometimes you will hear, “He’s too ‘菜’ at playing games.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Here, the term ‘菜’ means that this person is not good at playing games."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "有时候，人们也会说“菜鸟”，这是说一个新手。",
      "traditional": "有時候，人們也會說“菜鳥”，這是說一個新手。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu shí hou rén men yě huì shuō cài niǎo zhè shì shuō yí ge xīn shǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "我们可以说：“我刚学会开车，今天第一天上路，是个菜鸟。”",
      "traditional": "我們可以說：“我剛學會開車，今天第一天上路，是個菜鳥。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men kě yǐ shuō wǒ gāng xué huì kāi chē jīn tiān dì yī tiān shàng lù shì ge cài niǎo",
      "english": "Sometimes, people will also say “菜鸟”, which refers to a novice."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "We can say, “I just learned how to drive, and today is my first day on the road. I’m a ‘菜鸟’.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "这些用法，让“菜”这个词变得很有意思。",
      "traditional": "這些用法，讓“菜”這個詞變得很有意思。",
      "pinyin": "zhè xiē yòng fǎ ràng cài zhè ge cí biàn de hěn yǒu yì si",
      "english": ""
    }
